{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/a-supervisor-s-worker-tool-hands-the-model-the-worker-s-result",
  "title": "A Supervisor with no strategy gives its supervisor one delegate_to_<worker> tool per worker in the room it is installed in: a call delegates the task to that worker in a child room, waits for it, and answers the model with the worker's status and result; the supervisor answers the room, its workers registered but never attached",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7.3",
    "§23.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_supervisor.py TestPerWorkerDelegation::test_wait_for_result_returns_output; tests/orchestration/test_strategy_supervisor.py TestSupervisorInstall::test_installs_router_hook, test_registers_workers_on_kit, test_injects_delegation_tools, test_sets_initial_state, test_delegation_tool_handler; tests/orchestration/test_supervisor_inline.py test_inline_delegation_returns_worker_output, test_child_room_has_no_orchestration, test_parent_state_unchanged_after_delegation. orchestration/strategies/supervisor/core.py install, _inject_per_worker.py (_worker_tool, _PerWorkerToolServer._delegate_and_wait); _worker_run.py run_worker. The router stamps the message for the supervisor; the worker's status entries are the worker run's (mode per_worker_wait), the terminal one naming its task.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sup",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Coordinator"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c1",
                  "name": "delegate_to_researcher",
                  "arguments": {
                    "task": "Find the facts."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Here are the facts."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "researcher",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Researcher",
          "description": "Finds facts."
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "The facts."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "r1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "strategies": [
      {
        "id": "team",
        "supervisor": {
          "supervisor": "sup",
          "workers": [
            "researcher"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "seen",
        "trigger": "on_ai_response",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "install_strategy",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "strategy": "team"
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Find it."
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "researcher",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "agent_id": "researcher",
            "action": "task",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Find the facts.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "mode": "per_worker_wait",
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "researcher",
            "action": "task",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "The facts.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "mode": "per_worker_wait",
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "r1": [
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Find it."
          },
          "metadata": {
            "_routed_to": "sup"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call_start",
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "tool_call",
            "tool_name": "delegate_to_researcher",
            "arguments": {
              "task": "Find the facts."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call_end",
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "tool_call",
            "tool_name": "delegate_to_researcher",
            "result": "{\"status\": \"completed\", \"worker\": \"researcher\", \"result\": \"The facts.\"}",
            "status": "completed"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup",
            "channel_type": "ai"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Here are the facts."
          },
          "chain_depth": 1,
          "responds_to": "r1#0"
        }
      ]
    },
    "rooms": {
      "r1": {
        "metadata": {
          "_conversation_state": {
            "phase": "supervisor",
            "active_agent_id": "sup",
            "previous_agent_id": null,
            "handoff_count": 0,
            "phase_history": [],
            "context": {}
          }
        }
      },
      "$r1": {
        "metadata": {
          "task_agent_id": "researcher",
          "task_input": "Find the facts.",
          "task_result": "The facts.",
          "_conversation_state": {
            "$absent": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "bindings": {
      "r1": {
        "sup": {
          "category": "intelligence"
        },
        "researcher": null
      }
    },
    "hooks": {
      "seen": [
        {
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "researcher",
            "declared_tools": {
              "delegate_to_researcher": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "room_id": "r1",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "sup",
            "declared_tools": {
              "delegate_to_researcher": {
                "position": 0,
                "description": "Delegate a task to researcher. Finds facts.",
                "parameters": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "task": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Description of the task to delegate"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "task"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "models": {
      "sup": [
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Find it."
            }
          ],
          "tools": {
            "delegate_to_researcher": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "tool_results": [
            {
              "tool_call_id": "c1",
              "content": "{\"status\": \"completed\", \"worker\": \"researcher\", \"result\": \"The facts.\"}",
              "is_error": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "researcher": [
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Find the facts."
            }
          ],
          "tools": {
            "delegate_to_researcher": {
              "$absent": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
